{"default":{"entry":{"id":"community-030","title":"艺术无界·中欧共生国际艺术交流节","kind":"notice","category":"creative","category_label":"文化创作","summary":"中国-东盟艺术学院举办国际文化艺术交流节，安排多种线下艺术活动，供师生参与体验。","tags":["文化创作","官方公告"],"editorial_note":"","featured":true,"spotlight":false,"material_ids":[],"versions":[{"notice_id":"notice-6c3dac378a2fc5bc8127af45","year":2025,"published":"2025-10-27","deadline":null,"deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":null,"stage_end":null,"colleges":["college-17"],"levels":["international"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"依据公告标题中的范围词；选拔阶段单独保留。","audience":"全校师生。","audience_scope":{"kind":"campus","colleges":[],"evidence":"全校师生。"},"source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/47879.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":null,"content_profile":{"sections":[],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"benefits":false,"duties":false,"other":true},"truncated":true},"participation_facts":[]}],"collegeSelections":[]},"notice":{"notice_id":"notice-6c3dac378a2fc5bc8127af45","year":2025,"published":"2025-10-27","deadline":null,"deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":null,"stage_end":null,"colleges":["college-17"],"levels":["international"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"依据公告标题中的范围词；选拔阶段单独保留。","audience":"全校师生。","audience_scope":{"kind":"campus","colleges":[],"evidence":"全校师生。"},"source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/47879.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registration_windows":[],"fact_count":0,"content_profile":{"schema_version":"activity-profile-1","processed_on":"2026-10-17","status":"partial","sections":[{"kind":"other","title":"参与信息","items":[{"text":"全校师生：","locator":"正文第1段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/47879.htm"},{"text":"2025年，我们将迎来中欧全面战略伙伴关系建立50周年。半个世纪以来，中欧双方在经贸、科技、教育、人文艺术等领域的合作成果丰硕。","locator":"正文第3段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/47879.htm"},{"text":"为促进青年国际艺术交流，成都大学中国-东盟艺术学院将于10月28日至11月14日举办为期18天的“艺术无界·中欧共生”国际文化艺术交流节。我们准备了丰富多彩的线下活动，带你沉浸式体验艺术的魅力！","locator":"正文第5段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/47879.htm"},{"text":"我们邀请了来自俄罗斯、爱沙尼亚、德国、韩国、泰国、印度尼西亚等多个国家的艺术专家与代表，共同参与本次交流节。活动涵盖音乐会、工作坊、国际日、展览、讲座等多种形式，带你领略不同文化背景下的艺术表达，激发创作灵感。","locator":"正文第9段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/47879.htm"},{"text":"橙子们，快来带上你的朋友与热情，一起加入这场中西交融的艺术盛宴吧！","locator":"正文第13段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/47879.htm"},{"text":"在“艺术无界·中欧共生”的舞台上，我们期待与你相遇，共同书写属于我们的艺术故事！","locator":"正文第15段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/47879.htm"},{"text":"成都大学中国-东盟艺术学院","locator":"正文第18段","source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/47879.htm"}]}],"attachments":[],"pending":["参与对象本批未提取到","条件限制本批未提取到","地点本批未提取到","报名步骤本批未提取到","材料本批未提取到","日程本批未提取到","活动内容本批未提取到","费用与奖励本批未提取到","岗位职责本批未提取到"],"coverage":{"audience":false,"conditions":false,"location":false,"registration":false,"materials":false,"schedule":false,"content":false,"benefits":false,"duties":false,"other":true}},"participation_facts":[]},"groups":[],"activity_id":"community-030"},"notices":{"notice-6c3dac378a2fc5bc8127af45":{"entry":{"id":"community-030","title":"艺术无界·中欧共生国际艺术交流节","kind":"notice","category":"creative","category_label":"文化创作","summary":"中国-东盟艺术学院举办国际文化艺术交流节，安排多种线下艺术活动，供师生参与体验。","tags":["文化创作","官方公告"],"editorial_note":"","featured":true,"spotlight":false,"material_ids":[],"versions":[{"notice_id":"notice-6c3dac378a2fc5bc8127af45","year":2025,"published":"2025-10-27","deadline":null,"deadline_kind":"notice","stage_start":null,"stage_end":null,"colleges":["college-17"],"levels":["international"],"college_role":"原文相关单位，不代表报名限制","level_basis":"依据公告标题中的范围词；选拔阶段单独保留。","audience":"全校师生。","audience_scope":{"kind":"campus","colleges":[],"evidence":"全校师生。"},"source_url":"https://news.cdu.edu.cn/info/1112/47879.htm","conflict":false,"edition_label":"","original_title":"","registrati